cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mixedcheck, please cite it as below."
title: "mixedcheck: Design audits and diagnostics for mixed-effects models"
abstract: "A pair of packages, one for R and one for Python, that audit study designs before mixed-effects models are fitted and diagnose and report fitted models. Both packages share one registry of checks and one results schema."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bernabeu
    given-names: Pablo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1083-2460"
    email: pcbernabeu@gmail.com
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/pablobernabeu/mixedcheck"
keywords:
  - mixed-effects models
  - multilevel models
  - study design
  - model diagnostics
